msgid "音频接口"
msgstr "Audio interfaces"

msgid "设备与行为"
msgstr "Devices and behavior"

msgid ""
"音频支持取决于控制器、codec、路由和当前构建。ALSA/OSS 兼容接口只承诺 实际实现的格式与操作，不因使用上游 alsa-lib 就自动符合完整 Linux 音频 ABI。 "
"缓冲写入需处理非阻塞短写、回压、排空、占用及错误，不能丢弃未完成数据。 应用应明确区分静音、无设备和播放失败。"
msgstr ""
"Audio support depends on the controller, codec, routing, and current build. ALSA/OSS compatibility"
" interfaces promise only implemented formats and operations; using upstream alsa-lib does not "
"automatically imply full Linux audio ABI conformance. Buffered writes must handle nonblocking "
"short writes, backpressure, draining, occupancy, and errors without dropping unfinished data. "
"Applications should clearly distinguish mute, missing devices, and playback failure."

msgid "验证状态"
msgstr "Validation status"

msgid ""
"机器可读的音频支持清单位于 ``kernel/reliefnt/configs/audio-abi-support.json``。 这份数据在文档整理时保持内容不变；其 "
"guest_runtime/upstream_alsa 语义及 既有断言冲突仍需按原问题处理，不能通过修改标志掩盖。 ReliefPlayer 的具体编解码和输出范围见 "
":doc:`../applications/reliefplayer`。"
msgstr ""
"The machine-readable audio support manifest is ``kernel/reliefnt/configs/audio-abi-support.json``."
" Documentation reorganization leaves its contents unchanged. Its guest_runtime/upstream_alsa "
"semantics and existing assertion conflicts still require resolution as the original issues; "
"changing flags must not hide them. For ReliefPlayer's specific codec and output scope, see "
":doc:`../applications/reliefplayer`."

msgid "控制设备与 soundctl"
msgstr "Control devices and soundctl"

msgid "使用 ``soundctl cards`` 列出卡号，``soundctl --card 0 controls`` 列出当前设备 实际提供的名称、ID、范围和通道数。示例::"
msgstr ""
"Use ``soundctl cards`` to list card numbers and ``soundctl --card 0 controls`` to list the names, "
"IDs, ranges, and channel counts actually offered by the device. Example::"

msgid ""
"名称依卡而变。Master Playback Switch 的 on 表示打开，而 Playback Mute 的 on "
"表示静音。百分比按真实范围和步长取整；单值广播所有通道，多值必须匹配通道数。 枚举接受查询到的标签或项目 ID。route headphones 与 capture-source "
"microphone 依赖 Output Source/Input Source 控件，缺少时返回 ENOTSUP，不假定固定项目编号。"
msgstr ""
"Names vary by card. on for Master Playback Switch means enabled, whereas on for Playback Mute "
"means muted. Percentages are rounded to actual ranges and steps; a single value broadcasts to all "
"channels, while multiple values must match the channel count. Enumerations accept queried labels "
"or item IDs. route headphones and capture-source microphone depend on Output Source/Input Source "
"controls and return ENOTSUP if absent; fixed item numbers are not assumed."

msgid ""
"访问遵守设备节点 DAC。当前默认节点由 root 拥有、模式 0666，管理员可通过 chmod/chown 限制；播放与录音节点的 DAC 独立。控制元素的锁属于打开的文件描述 "
"对象（OFD），dup/fork 共享该对象；其他 OFD 不能窃取锁，最后引用关闭时释放。 事件订阅与排队也依附 OFD。不要按同名进程、路径或裸 fd 数字推断所有权。"
msgstr ""
"Access follows device-node DAC. Default nodes are currently root-owned with mode 0666; "
"administrators may restrict them with chmod/chown. Playback and recording nodes have independent "
"DAC. Control-element locks belong to the open file description (OFD), shared by dup/fork; other "
"OFDs cannot steal them, and the final close releases them. Event subscriptions and queues also "
"belong to the OFD. Do not infer ownership from process names, paths, or bare fd numbers."

msgid "共享 PCM 与状态"
msgstr "Shared PCM and state"

msgid ""
"默认播放使用 dmix、录音使用 dsnoop，硬件端为 hw:0,0。当前配置周期 8192 帧、 硬件缓冲 65536 帧，48 kHz 下约 170.7 ms 周期及 1.365 s "
"缓冲，有明显延迟成本。 共享服务持有对应方向的硬件租约，直接打开 hw:0,0 可能返回 EBUSY。 没有录音端点时不会伪造 capture 节点。"
msgstr ""
"Playback defaults to dmix and recording to dsnoop, with hw:0,0 as the hardware endpoint. Current "
"configuration uses an 8192-frame period and 65536-frame hardware buffer: about 170.7 ms and 1.365 "
"s at 48 kHz, a substantial latency cost. Shared services hold hardware leases for the "
"corresponding direction; opening hw:0,0 directly may return EBUSY. No capture node is fabricated "
"when a recording endpoint is absent."

msgid ""
"OpenRC reliefos-audio 服务在存在时恢复 /var/lib/alsa/asound.state；停止时先写 临时文件，再发布新状态，保存失败保留原状态。修改 "
"/etc/asound.conf 前先记录 设备、格式与运行日志，不用扩大缓冲掩盖有限流输出错误。"
msgstr ""
"The OpenRC reliefos-audio service restores /var/lib/alsa/asound.state if present. On stop, it "
"writes a temporary file before publishing new state, preserving the original on save failure. "
"Before changing /etc/asound.conf, record devices, formats, and runtime logs; do not hide finite-"
"stream output errors by enlarging buffers."

msgid "错误处理与验收边界"
msgstr "Error handling and acceptance boundaries"

msgid "EAGAIN：非阻塞临时回压，保留正数短传输进度并按 poll 重试，保留 EINTR。"
msgstr ""
"EAGAIN: temporary nonblocking backpressure; retain progress from positive short transfers, retry "
"according to poll, and preserve EINTR."

msgid "EPIPE：真实 XRUN，恢复前需 PREPARE；不能吞掉 XRUN 作为正常结束。"
msgstr ""
"EPIPE: a real XRUN requiring PREPARE before recovery; do not swallow XRUN as normal completion."

msgid "EBUSY：可能是共享服务器或其他打开者持有独占硬件方向。"
msgstr "EBUSY: a shared server or another opener may hold the exclusive hardware direction."

msgid "ENODEV/ENOENT：区分存在但不可用的兼容节点与缺失的真实端点。"
msgstr ""
"ENODEV/ENOENT: distinguish an existing but unusable compatibility node from a missing real "
"endpoint."

msgid "非阻塞 DRAIN 还需观察 STATUS 到达 SETUP；完成通知的 POLLERR 不能单独变成 EIO， STATUS XRUN 仍是失败。"
msgstr ""
"Nonblocking DRAIN also requires observing STATUS reaching SETUP. Completion-notification POLLERR "
"alone must not become EIO; STATUS XRUN still indicates failure."

msgid ""
"用 aplay -l、arecord -l、amixer -c 0 contents、设备权限及 HDA/PCM 日志定位。 完整有限流、重复关闭重开、长期 XRUN 清洁度与真实 VMware "
"HDA 可听性仍有未完成 验收；历史 EPIPE 与尾帧损失反例不能由一次重跑成功抹去。物理 codec 未验证。 AC97/ES1371 的窄 OSS 路线不等于 ALSA "
"卡支持，具体状态仍以支持清单与真实运行为准。"
msgstr ""
"Diagnose with aplay -l, arecord -l, amixer -c 0 contents, device permissions, and HDA/PCM logs. "
"Acceptance remains incomplete for entire finite streams, repeated close/reopen, long-term absence "
"of XRUNs, and actual audible VMware HDA output. One successful rerun cannot erase historical EPIPE"
" and lost-tail-frame counterexamples. Physical codecs are unverified. The narrow AC97/ES1371 OSS "
"path does not imply ALSA card support; consult the support manifest and actual runs for status."
